For each technology, the lifetime usable energy is

E_{\text{usable,lifetime}} = E_{\text{usable}} \times N_{\text{cycles}} \times \bar{\eta}_{\text{RT}},

where \bar{\eta}_{\text{RT}} is the average round-trip efficiency over the cycle life.

T³ES-G:

E_{\text{usable,lifetime}} = 675 \times 10{,}000 \times 0.406 = 2{,}740{,}500\ \text{kWh}.

